  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pan over medium heat",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 3 minutes",
    "Add the mushroom and cook until tender, about 4 minutes",
    "Add the pumpkin and cook until tender, about 5 minutes",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the soy sauce and rice vinegar",
    "Pour the sauce over the pumpkin mixture and stir to combine",
    "Add the mashed potatoes to the pan and stir to combine",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste",
    "Using a spatula, shape the mixture into a bubble and squeak shape",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes, until the bottom is crispy and golden brown",
    "Garnish with parsley and serve hot"
